  "description": "Mad Love the Prequel is the first extended play by Jamaican dancehall musician Sean Paul. It was released by SPJ Productions, Dutty Rock Productions, and Island Records on 29 June 2018. The EP spawned six singles: \"No Lie\" featuring Dua Lipa, \"Tek Weh Yuh Heart\" featuring Tory Lanez, \"Body\" featuring Migos, \"Mad Love\" with David Guetta featuring Becky G, \"Tip Pon It\" featuring Major Lazer, and \"Naked Truth\" featuring Jhené Aiko.",
